<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;netstandard2.1;net472;net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <PackageId>EgonsoftHU.Text.Json</PackageId>
    <VersionPrefix>10.0.0</VersionPrefix>
    <!--
    <VersionSuffix>$([System.String]::Format('prerelease-{0:000}-{1:0000}', $([System.DateTime]::Now.DayOfYear), $([System.Math]::Floor($([System.DateTime]::Now.TimeOfDay.TotalMinutes)))))</VersionSuffix>
    -->
    <!--<Authors></Authors>-->
    <!--<Owners></Owners>-->
    <Title>Egonsoft.HU JSON Library</Title>
    <Description>System.Text.Json extensions.

Supports any attribute for enum member serialization.
Provides option for using your own custom serializer implementation for enum members.

Built-in attribute support:
System.Text.Json.Serialization.JsonStringEnumMemberNameAttribute
System.Runtime.Serialization.EnumMemberAttribute
System.ComponentModel.DescriptionAttribute
System.ComponentModel.DisplayNameAttribute
System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.DisplayAttribute

Commonly Used Types:
EgonsoftHU.Text.Json.Serialization.EgonsoftJsonStringEnumConverterFactory
EgonsoftHU.Text.Json.Serialization.Converters.JsonEnumValueSerializer
EgonsoftHU.Text.Json.JsonSerializerOptionsProvider</Description>
    <Summary>System.Text.Json extensions.

Supports any attribute for enum member serialization.
Provides option for using your own custom serializer implementation for enum members.

Built-in attribute support:
System.Text.Json.Serialization.JsonStringEnumMemberNameAttribute
System.Runtime.Serialization.EnumMemberAttribute
System.ComponentModel.DescriptionAttribute
System.ComponentModel.DisplayNameAttribute
System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.DisplayAttribute

Commonly Used Types:
EgonsoftHU.Text.Json.Serialization.EgonsoftJsonStringEnumConverterFactory
EgonsoftHU.Text.Json.Serialization.Converters.JsonEnumValueSerializer
EgonsoftHU.Text.Json.JsonSerializerOptionsProvider</Summary>
